  "review": "Independent read-only review identified and root fixed sticky drift, engine binding, shutdown-extension schema, separate cleanup reporting and bounded guard completion.",
  "identity_limits": [
    "Opt-in only; static default unchanged. Per-process cache: eight verified profiles, 300-second lifetime, 15-second cooldown, at most five-second singleflight wait.",
    "Eight checks use real in-memory cryptographic signatures; provider/HTTP replies are modeled. Native Keycloak rotation, MFA and browser behavior are unrun."
  ],
  "preservation_limits": [
    "An independent 14-minute active watchdog is followed by a fixed 60-second delayed-operation observation window. Its native calls have bounded timeouts; main waits at most four minutes for completion and retains actual elapsed drain time. These are sampled safeguards, not hard quotas or indefinite settlement.",
    "Retain the 12-GiB cumulative disk guard including prior use, 25-GiB disk reserve, 4-GiB host-memory reserve and 10-GiB/30-GiB milestone ceilings. Whole-host changes are not solely attributable to this stage.",
    "Main and independent shutdown, exact source/native record/alert reconciliation and unchanged sampled preserved envelopes are all required. Preserve private baseline, output receipts and stopped collector; never stop Desktop or existing workloads.",
    "Snapshot compatibility, native collection, application health and uninterrupted service remain unverified. No claim of protection from a hostile engine administrator or resource competitor."
